    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0329" n="264" sameAs="frus:frus1936v03/pg264"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.84/67: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis
                                Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-05T06:00:00+03:00">May 5, 1936—6 a.m.</date><lb/>[Received
                        May 4—11:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>288. Nothing has happened since my 287 to alter views expressed then. There is
                    still some firing but much less than this time yesterday and we are in no
                    immediate danger.</p>
                <p>Much appreciate your repeating to me message in your 185<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d291-f1"/> which is admirably worded.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
